# amd64 external-media-data support — appended for client desktops when the
# media-data feature is ON (default; --no-media-data to skip). Provides:
#  - gocryptfs : decrypt the /media/Vaults encrypted store (this fleet's Vaults
#                are a gocryptfs ciphertext dir on the data disk).
#  - udisks    : let the desktop user mount/unmount the attached data device.
#  - flatpak   : present for the --steam flatpak fallback + general Flatpak use.
#                (Native Steam is the DEFAULT — games-util/steam-launcher comes
#                from packages-steam-native.list, gated to the gaming desktops.)
app-crypt/gocryptfs
sys-fs/fuse
sys-fs/udisks
sys-apps/flatpak
